# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
release/
dist-electron/
www/
Reeldeck.apk

# Android (Capacitor) build outputs & machine-specific config
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties

# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.iml
*.log

# Signing key material. The Android release key must NEVER be committed: it is what
# lets an update install over an existing app, and anyone holding it can sign an APK
# that replaces yours. It lives outside the repo and reaches CI as a secret.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.b64
keystore.properties

# The Worker is deployed by pasting it into the Cloudflare dashboard, so the copy here
# is a convenience -- and it holds the mirror table. Keeping it out of the repository is
# the entire point of having moved that table off the client: publishing it here would
# put the URLs straight back on raw.githubusercontent.com.
worker/
